== Effect ==
* Increases the chance of {{E|Eternal Heart}}s appearing by 3%.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}}: Adds additional chance for {{E|Eternal Heart}}s appearing by 3% per stack.

== Notes ==
* Despite its pickup quote, this trinket does not alter the chance of finding {{R|Angel Room}}s in any way.

