== Trivia ==
* This trinket is a reference to [[wikipedia:tract (literature)|religious tracts]]. Its sprite also resembles a Chick tract, a brand of comic-style tracts. This is further supported by Chick tract style comics being included in some physical editions of The Binding of Isaac.

